WEBVTT

00:02.050 --> 00:04.440
Welcome home, darling.

00:04.880 --> 00:06.900
Would you like a bath?

00:07.290 --> 00:08.860
Or dinner?

00:09.160 --> 00:11.200
Or maybe...

00:11.200 --> 00:13.460
me?

00:16.600 --> 00:18.700
I could eat you up right now!

00:20.690 --> 00:23.610
Oh, Satou...

00:23.610 --> 00:25.780
honestly, you're so naughty.

00:35.360 --> 00:36.490
Why?

00:36.490 --> 00:37.970
Huh?!

00:36.590 --> 00:36.970
<b><b>Huh?!</b></b>

00:38.670 --> 00:41.230
Here I go, Nefritis.

00:41.230 --> 00:43.430
Yes, Satou-sama.

00:43.430 --> 00:47.150
Wait! That's where I'm supposed to be!

00:47.150 --> 00:49.730
No!

00:52.490 --> 00:54.390
Oh, just a dream?

00:59.660 --> 01:02.220
Here. It's hot, so be careful.

01:02.220 --> 01:03.870
O-Okay!

01:04.170 --> 01:05.080
Hmm?

01:05.370 --> 01:07.040
Hime, you're up?

01:07.040 --> 01:08.620
Food's ready.

01:08.620 --> 01:10.380
Oh, yeah.

01:10.380 --> 01:13.620
You should rest while you can.

01:14.170 --> 01:17.640
So, which ring nation are we heading to next?

01:17.640 --> 01:20.330
I was planning to head for the Land of Water.

01:20.330 --> 01:22.330
It's the nation of dragonfolk.

01:22.330 --> 01:23.470
Sounds great!

01:23.470 --> 01:25.790
I wanted to visit there myself.

01:25.790 --> 01:26.730
Ow!

01:26.730 --> 01:28.120
Are you okay?

01:28.120 --> 01:30.310
I guess it was still too hot.

01:31.150 --> 01:32.650
Hmm...

01:33.200 --> 01:34.320
<i>Now that I think about it,</i>

01:35.190 --> 01:39.720
<i>Satou has been spending 
all his time with Nefritis lately.</i>

01:42.880 --> 01:45.120
Hey, Satou, what about mine?

01:45.120 --> 01:46.200
Oh, sorry.

01:46.200 --> 01:47.750
Go ahead and help yourself, Hime.

01:47.750 --> 01:48.710
Wha?!

01:50.380 --> 01:52.340
Who goes that far?!

01:52.340 --> 01:53.670
Hime?!

01:57.000 --> 01:58.240
It's nothing.

01:59.340 --> 02:00.760
Hime!

02:03.870 --> 02:06.480
What's that sound?

02:12.920 --> 02:15.260
What's this?

02:16.920 --> 02:19.830
The town is moving?!

02:20.780 --> 02:23.040
Oh, lucky us!

02:23.040 --> 02:25.340
I didn't think we'd meet it out here!

02:27.300 --> 02:30.040
This is the Land of Fire, Needakitta,

02:30.480 --> 02:34.310
the nation of wandering knights and cat people.

04:08.680 --> 04:11.140
This is a nation?

04:12.140 --> 04:15.400
I figured we'd run across it somewhere,

04:15.400 --> 04:17.500
but we can't let this chance pass us by!

04:17.500 --> 04:20.360
We're going to retrieve the Ring 
of Fire from the princess here!

04:20.720 --> 04:22.760
The Land of Water can come later!

04:24.220 --> 04:26.320
Is that so...

04:26.650 --> 04:29.960
<i>Did he want to go to
 the Land of Water that badly?</i>

04:29.960 --> 04:31.960
<i>I wonder if he's close to someone there.</i>

04:34.450 --> 04:37.360
But how are we supposed 
to enter something like this?

04:37.360 --> 04:39.210
Leave that to me.

04:39.210 --> 04:42.670
Hey! Can we come aboard?

04:47.330 --> 04:48.640
A ladder?!

04:48.640 --> 04:50.190
Hurry up and climb up.

04:50.190 --> 04:51.910
It's way too dusty down here!

04:57.810 --> 05:00.520
<b><b>Wobble...</b></b>

04:59.160 --> 05:00.520
Nefritis?!

05:01.300 --> 05:04.080
This is where we must part ways.

05:04.080 --> 05:05.850
It was a fun journey.

05:05.850 --> 05:07.240
Giving up so quickly?!

05:08.330 --> 05:10.810
It's okay, Nefritis! I'll—

05:11.160 --> 05:12.080
Satou!

05:12.080 --> 05:15.210
<b><b>Squeeze!</b></b>

05:12.480 --> 05:15.390
I'll keep an eye on Nefritis!

05:15.390 --> 05:16.780
S-Sure!

05:19.300 --> 05:21.250
You can do it!

05:21.250 --> 05:24.250
Yeah... Hup.

05:29.620 --> 05:31.940
Hey, what are you looking at!

05:32.310 --> 05:33.720
Whoa, watch it!

05:33.720 --> 05:35.080
Be careful!

05:35.080 --> 05:37.810
You won't fare well if you fall.

05:42.180 --> 05:45.290
You did well, Nefritis.

05:45.290 --> 05:47.240
I'm already exhausted.

05:47.970 --> 05:48.980
Wow!

05:55.800 --> 05:57.410
These are supposed to be knights?

05:57.860 --> 06:01.590
It just looks like an open market to me.

06:02.040 --> 06:05.850
Many strong cat people make up
Needakitta's knights.

06:05.850 --> 06:10.750
Therefore, many merchants sought to travel 
with them for their protection,

06:10.750 --> 06:13.700
and in doing so it eventually 
became a massive caravan.

06:13.700 --> 06:16.060
It's exactly like my books described!

06:16.060 --> 06:19.340
Yes, you're well informed.

06:19.340 --> 06:23.800
The cat people lost their nation 
during the era of the first Ring King,

06:23.800 --> 06:26.270
so they built their capital on wheels

06:26.270 --> 06:30.280
and became a nation that traveled the world 
selling their martial prowess.

06:30.280 --> 06:33.450
Perhaps it would be easier 
to call them mercenaries?

06:33.720 --> 06:36.570
However, the world's most powerful knights

06:36.570 --> 06:40.490
have now created the world's 
safest mobile market.

06:40.490 --> 06:44.440
Every town the Land of Fire, 
Needakitta, passes by

06:44.440 --> 06:47.530
is able to acquire all manner of goods.

06:47.530 --> 06:48.380
Hmm...

06:48.860 --> 06:49.980
Now!

06:49.980 --> 06:54.970
Let's start by asking for an audience 
with the Maiden of the Ring of Fire.

06:55.920 --> 06:58.380
Huh? The other two are gone!

07:00.150 --> 07:01.650
Amazing!

07:01.650 --> 07:03.320
It's amazing!

07:03.320 --> 07:05.730
There are so many rare books!

07:07.900 --> 07:13.320
Wow! This is the Imauniyai 
mentioned in the Dusk Records!

07:13.320 --> 07:15.370
Look at this, Satou-sama!

07:15.370 --> 07:16.080
This is—

07:17.080 --> 07:18.180
Huh?

07:18.180 --> 07:20.670
I think we got separated.

07:20.670 --> 07:21.830
Maybe we're in trouble?

07:23.290 --> 07:26.000
<b>Shiver... Shiver...</b>

07:24.020 --> 07:26.000
Huh?

07:26.000 --> 07:28.160
Wh-What do I do?!

07:28.160 --> 07:29.970
There are so many people I don't know!

07:29.970 --> 07:33.620
Blegh! I feel sick.

07:35.560 --> 07:37.100
I'm so sorry.

07:37.100 --> 07:38.360
I'm always causing trouble.

07:38.360 --> 07:40.560
It's fine. Don't worry about it.

07:40.880 --> 07:41.620
Hmm?

07:42.410 --> 07:44.840
Hey, hey, are those the cat people?

07:44.840 --> 07:48.480
Yes. They look just like 
my books described them.

07:48.480 --> 07:51.150
That's cute. 
It's like they're wearing cat ears.

07:51.150 --> 07:52.450
How can you say that?!

07:52.450 --> 07:55.960
The blood of ancient warriors 
courses through their veins.

07:55.960 --> 08:00.280
They're wild beasts that served the
Ring King with bravery and violence.

08:00.280 --> 08:02.710
Or so my books tell me.

08:02.710 --> 08:05.660
Also, elf ears are much cuter!

08:05.660 --> 08:06.670
They're long!

08:06.670 --> 08:08.650
I-I see...

08:08.650 --> 08:10.670
Hey, you two!

08:11.070 --> 08:13.010
Are you lost?

08:13.310 --> 08:14.400
Yes.

08:14.400 --> 08:17.950
Um, we got separated from our friends.

08:17.950 --> 08:18.890
I see.

08:19.280 --> 08:23.020
If you get lost in Needakitta, 
then you should head for the arena!

08:23.020 --> 08:25.100
It's the biggest landmark around.

08:25.520 --> 08:27.840
Th-Thank you so much.

08:27.840 --> 08:29.690
I hope you find your friends.

08:31.250 --> 08:34.070
They seem different 
from what I read in my books.

08:37.120 --> 08:40.580
I wonder where Hime and Nefritis got off to.

08:40.580 --> 08:43.180
Calm down, Satou-kun.

08:43.180 --> 08:45.470
Needakitta is a very safe place.

08:45.470 --> 08:47.420
There's only one place for them to go.

08:47.420 --> 08:49.370
It's where the Fire Princess is.

08:49.370 --> 08:51.800
Ah, I'm so worried!

08:53.260 --> 08:56.090
They're really staring at us.

08:56.090 --> 08:58.600
Are you sure this place is safe?

08:58.600 --> 09:03.350
Yeah. Cat people value strength most of all.

09:03.660 --> 09:05.990
Oh! I get it!

09:05.990 --> 09:08.930
I guess strength is just oozing off of me!

09:08.930 --> 09:11.480
Sorry, but my heart already belongs to someone.

09:11.480 --> 09:12.590
Hey!

09:12.590 --> 09:13.280
Hmm?

09:13.610 --> 09:17.800
I'm guessing from your stance and your build 
that you must be a famous swordsman.

09:17.800 --> 09:20.620
If you're interested, 
maybe we could get some tea together?

09:22.040 --> 09:24.800
You shouldn't be judging people 
by their appearances.

09:24.800 --> 09:27.710
That man there is far stronger than I am.

09:27.710 --> 09:30.680
Oh, you're so funny!

09:30.420 --> 09:35.220
<b>Gloom...</b>

09:31.190 --> 09:34.200
That boy doesn't have any muscles on him.

09:35.520 --> 09:37.230
By the way, girls,

09:37.230 --> 09:40.270
we were hoping to see this nation's princess.

09:40.270 --> 09:42.430
Do you know where we can go to meet her?

09:43.760 --> 09:46.140
Another one after the princess?

09:47.280 --> 09:48.460
All right!

09:48.460 --> 09:51.610
I guess that means you're hoping 
to court the princess, too!

09:52.420 --> 09:53.800
Court?!

09:57.460 --> 10:00.500
This is the arena, right?

10:02.320 --> 10:03.240
Here.

10:03.240 --> 10:05.080
Thank you so much.

10:05.400 --> 10:09.740
Wow, there're so many Imauniyai! 
They look delicious!

10:09.740 --> 10:11.420
I'm a little scared, but...

10:13.730 --> 10:15.470
It's delicious.

10:15.470 --> 10:17.590
It's surprisingly sweet.

10:17.960 --> 10:18.800
Hmm?

10:18.800 --> 10:21.470
You've got some on your cheek. Jeez.

10:24.800 --> 10:28.170
You're just like Satou-sama, Krystal-sama.

10:28.170 --> 10:29.770
Huh? How so?!

10:30.420 --> 10:32.990
You're both very kind.

10:32.990 --> 10:34.840
When I'm with you two,

10:34.840 --> 10:38.550
I feel like I'm being cared for 
by my mother and father.

10:38.240 --> 10:41.740
<b>Mother</b>

10:38.240 --> 10:41.740
<b>Daughter?!</b>

10:38.240 --> 10:41.740
<b>Father</b>

10:39.780 --> 10:41.740
Mother...

10:41.740 --> 10:43.150
No, no, no!

10:43.150 --> 10:45.020
You're older than me, Nefritis!

10:45.020 --> 10:47.770
There's no way you could be our daughter!

10:47.770 --> 10:48.710
Huh?

10:48.710 --> 10:52.150
Oh, no, it's nothing.

10:53.760 --> 10:57.400
I've been meaning to 
apologize to you, Krystal-sama.

10:57.400 --> 10:59.000
Huh? Why?

10:59.000 --> 11:03.550
Lately, Satou-sama has been 
focused on taking care of me.

11:03.550 --> 11:04.570
Huh?!

11:04.570 --> 11:06.840
It's not like I've been worried about that!

11:06.840 --> 11:10.380
You were raised like 
a real princess, unlike me.

11:10.380 --> 11:13.270
Satou's a rather caring person, anyway.

11:13.830 --> 11:16.730
But it still made you jealous, right?

11:18.340 --> 11:22.320
That's not... exactly untrue.

11:22.320 --> 11:23.640
My!

11:25.440 --> 11:29.200
I heard the heart aches more 
the deeper love grows.

11:29.200 --> 11:33.610
So I think that's proof that 
you truly love Satou-sama.

11:34.830 --> 11:39.960
Compared to you, I'm just 
watching him with admiration.

11:40.400 --> 11:44.970
I don't feel like I have strong feelings 
for him the way you do yet.

11:45.390 --> 11:47.370
But if that's how I feel...

11:47.370 --> 11:52.550
then will I be able to fulfill my duty 
as the Ring King's wife?

11:56.710 --> 11:57.980
Good grief.

11:57.980 --> 12:00.740
This guy didn't stand a chance either, huh?

12:04.660 --> 12:06.280
Oh, Satou!

12:06.600 --> 12:08.910
Hime! Nefritis is with you, too, huh?

12:09.610 --> 12:11.210
This is bad news.

12:11.210 --> 12:13.880
That guy just got beat up here.

12:13.880 --> 12:15.380
Huh? Why?

12:16.390 --> 12:17.740
Now, this way.

12:17.740 --> 12:20.130
To the stage people court our princess on!

12:40.710 --> 12:43.930
That's the Land of Fire's princess?!

12:45.060 --> 12:47.400
Who's next to court me?

12:51.680 --> 12:54.100
You're the Ring King?

12:55.400 --> 12:57.840
If you want to be my husband,

12:57.840 --> 13:00.460
then you must be stronger than me.

13:01.400 --> 13:03.170
Are you strong?

13:05.420 --> 13:06.590
I'll test you.

13:08.430 --> 13:09.550
Satou-kun!

13:18.190 --> 13:19.230
Satou!

13:20.660 --> 13:22.190
Out of the question.

13:22.520 --> 13:25.530
I expected better when I heard 
you were chosen as the Ring King,

13:26.240 --> 13:31.160
but how can a weakling face the monsters 
of the abyss, even if he has a ring?

13:31.470 --> 13:35.080
If you want to challenge me again, 
come back another day.

13:39.200 --> 13:43.100
I have lots of men 
who want to court me, after all.

13:51.530 --> 13:53.680
Make sure you watch your opponent's eyes.

13:54.010 --> 13:56.420
If you keep letting yourself 
get distracted by their blade...

13:58.000 --> 13:58.980
See?

14:00.120 --> 14:01.800
Ow.

14:01.800 --> 14:03.080
I can't even graze you.

14:03.080 --> 14:04.530
I'm really bad at this.

14:07.530 --> 14:08.570
Hey!

14:08.570 --> 14:10.270
Ring King and company!

14:10.270 --> 14:11.990
Food's ready!

14:12.280 --> 14:14.760
All right, let's take a little break.

14:20.240 --> 14:24.590
The Fire Princess's husband 
has to be someone strong.

14:24.590 --> 14:26.510
Still, our one problem is that

14:26.510 --> 14:30.550
not a single man in the nation 
is a match for the princess.

14:30.550 --> 14:34.270
That's why our princess started 
seeking out people willing to court her

14:34.270 --> 14:36.600
from races all across the world.

14:37.270 --> 14:42.150
Granart Needakitta is the strongest cat 
person of our generation, and our princess.

14:42.560 --> 14:44.980
Is she someone I can even beat?

14:46.150 --> 14:50.640
It would be impossible
 with your skill in the sword.

14:50.640 --> 14:52.030
Then what's the point of training?!

14:52.030 --> 14:53.660
And I kind of knew it was useless already!

14:54.270 --> 14:57.500
Have you forgotten what's on your left hand?

15:01.940 --> 15:03.070
Is that okay?!

15:03.070 --> 15:04.880
Using magic wouldn't be fair, would it?

15:05.950 --> 15:09.150
Magic power is basically a mage's muscles.

15:09.150 --> 15:12.000
It's a fair part of your strength, mister.

15:12.000 --> 15:15.210
Human wizards often come to court her, too.

15:15.210 --> 15:17.220
Though they've all been trounced!

15:18.480 --> 15:21.900
The magic of the rings 
is a strength on another level.

15:21.900 --> 15:24.560
If you employ it well, 
then you'll have a chance to win.

15:24.560 --> 15:25.940
Maybe.

15:27.940 --> 15:29.640
Go on, eat more.

15:29.640 --> 15:31.630
You'll never get stronger if you don't eat.

15:31.630 --> 15:33.030
Yeah!

15:44.320 --> 15:46.170
<i>More courting again today?</i>

15:51.050 --> 15:52.680
Wow!

16:08.480 --> 16:09.530
Satou!

16:09.530 --> 16:12.170
Wah! Hime?

16:12.170 --> 16:14.970
You look beat.
 All done for today already?

16:14.970 --> 16:17.310
No, just taking a little break.

16:17.310 --> 16:20.650
Your grandpa is teaching me 
magic in the afternoon.

16:20.650 --> 16:22.000
Really?

16:23.330 --> 16:25.210
Lie down for a bit.

16:25.580 --> 16:26.670
Hmm?

16:28.290 --> 16:30.880
A little reward for all your hard work.

16:30.880 --> 16:33.820
Wow, this is a great view.

16:34.710 --> 16:36.250
Feel more motivated?

16:36.250 --> 16:41.770
Forget motivated! I can work as hard 
as I need to if you're doing this for me!

16:41.770 --> 16:44.100
You're so simple.

16:52.600 --> 16:53.820
Hey...

16:53.820 --> 16:54.700
Hmm?

16:55.240 --> 16:59.030
I think it's okay for you to be weak.

16:59.030 --> 16:59.670
Hmm?!

17:00.950 --> 17:02.620
But I can't stay weak.

17:03.730 --> 17:08.000
You have to marry five princesses 
and gather the rings.

17:08.000 --> 17:11.880
As long as you use 
the ring's power well, that's enough.

17:12.370 --> 17:15.880
The strength of the rings 
is the strength of our bonds.

17:15.880 --> 17:19.010
I'll do my best on my end for that.

17:19.400 --> 17:23.160
So you don't need to force yourself 
to grow stronger.

17:24.600 --> 17:28.480
But wouldn't I... be really uncool, then?

17:28.750 --> 17:31.940
A little uncool is just perfect for you, Satou.

17:33.400 --> 17:34.730
I like it!

17:37.220 --> 17:38.570
Satou-kun!

17:38.570 --> 17:41.330
It's time to start your magic training.

17:42.440 --> 17:43.560
I'm heading off.

17:51.120 --> 17:55.210
I couldn't understand 
a single thing that old man said!

17:55.210 --> 17:55.920
Hmm?

17:56.520 --> 17:58.420
How's the pressure?

17:59.440 --> 18:00.330
Gulp...

18:00.330 --> 18:01.220
Satou-kun.

18:02.230 --> 18:03.640
Ow.

18:04.220 --> 18:06.530
You worked hard today.

18:06.530 --> 18:09.350
You're doing well for someone 
who just took up the sword.

18:10.230 --> 18:12.250
I'm kind of surprised.

18:12.250 --> 18:15.570
You're so skilled at 
martial arts stuff, too, Marse-san.

18:15.900 --> 18:18.030
Did I seem that frail to you?

18:18.030 --> 18:22.120
No, you just seem like you don't like fighting.

18:22.120 --> 18:23.280
Somehow.

18:23.890 --> 18:28.540
Those born of the Emperor 
must excel in both pen and sword.

18:29.000 --> 18:31.980
That's just what the Empire I'm from is like.

18:32.680 --> 18:35.690
My father and older brother 
are even more outstanding than me.

18:36.120 --> 18:38.150
I could hardly compare to them.

18:39.100 --> 18:41.520
If you had become the Ring King,

18:41.520 --> 18:45.110
do you think you could have beat Granart, 
the Land of Fire's princess?

18:45.770 --> 18:49.580
Even I probably couldn't beat her 
in a contest of swordsmanship alone.

18:49.580 --> 18:50.780
She's that strong?!

18:52.000 --> 18:54.610
Would you two men like a scrub, as well?

18:54.610 --> 18:56.420
It feels really good!

18:57.610 --> 19:00.070
I think I might take you up on that!

19:00.070 --> 19:02.910
One customer, if you'd please!

19:02.910 --> 19:04.870
Please!

19:05.590 --> 19:07.700
Time for a scrub!

19:08.030 --> 19:08.960
Huh?

19:11.540 --> 19:13.500
Wha?!

19:13.500 --> 19:15.340
Well, I'll be going now.

19:15.340 --> 19:16.410
No way!

19:16.410 --> 19:19.080
Smooth skin is key to being popular!

19:19.080 --> 19:21.220
It'll blow away all the fatigue 
from your training, too.

19:21.220 --> 19:22.250
Wait!

19:23.090 --> 19:25.500
Now, let's get started!

19:28.430 --> 19:33.020
<b><b>Sparkly Smooth</b></b>

19:28.710 --> 19:31.210
Now you're a proper man!

19:35.940 --> 19:37.210
Princess?!

19:38.220 --> 19:40.350
Satou, was it?

19:40.350 --> 19:42.780
You can call me Granart, too.

19:43.440 --> 19:46.450
Well? He got a lot of your fatigue out, right?

19:47.040 --> 19:47.960
Hmm...

19:47.960 --> 19:50.290
Since we're here, maybe I'll ask you for one.

19:55.630 --> 19:57.760
Uh, what?

19:57.760 --> 19:59.340
Scrub me.

19:59.340 --> 20:01.880
You just had it done, 
so surely you can do it, too.

20:01.880 --> 20:05.240
But I'm a man! And I've never done this!

20:05.240 --> 20:06.600
I don't care.

20:07.240 --> 20:09.950
You tried to court me and lost.

20:09.950 --> 20:12.690
So you can do at least one thing I ask, right?

20:13.480 --> 20:14.580
All right...

20:18.650 --> 20:22.110
Well? How's my body?

20:22.560 --> 20:24.570
<i>A-Amazing.</i>

20:24.880 --> 20:28.710
<i>She has thick, refined muscles 
under her smooth skin.</i>

20:29.480 --> 20:32.740
<i>I could never match her 
in simple physical strength!</i>

20:33.680 --> 20:36.670
I'm tired from today's courting, too.

20:36.670 --> 20:41.020
The people challenging me 
have nothing but glory on their minds.

20:41.020 --> 20:43.560
To be honest, I'm already growing sick of it.

20:43.560 --> 20:44.380
Huh?

20:44.380 --> 20:46.970
Then you appeared.

20:46.970 --> 20:50.920
It is a Ring Princess's duty 
to serve the Ring King.

20:50.920 --> 20:53.600
So I wouldn't mind lending you a hand.

20:56.480 --> 21:00.480
I'm saying that I wouldn't mind losing 
the next time you court me.

21:00.480 --> 21:01.420
Wha?!

21:01.420 --> 21:02.240
Shh!

21:02.240 --> 21:03.910
You're too loud.

21:04.750 --> 21:07.280
Though we would have to 
save face in front of others.

21:07.280 --> 21:09.590
So we'll need you to put on a bit of a show.

21:11.120 --> 21:13.550
Then you can make me yours,

21:13.550 --> 21:15.590
just like you did the other princesses.

21:16.320 --> 21:17.540
I think...

21:17.820 --> 21:20.100
you'll be able to enjoy this body quite a bit.

21:21.500 --> 21:25.040
I can tell those rings 
aren't just for decoration.

21:25.040 --> 21:28.760
At the very least, you're already 
qualified to wear them.

21:31.280 --> 21:33.680
So I'll do my part 
to go along with what you do.

21:36.060 --> 21:38.650
I don't need you to go easy on me!

21:39.070 --> 21:41.110
I'm coming to win for real.

21:42.640 --> 21:45.720
Then give it your best try.

22:00.800 --> 22:03.260
<i>"I've got to get stronger," my foot!</i>

22:03.880 --> 22:05.300
That's so uncool.
